<title>CHINA: Culturecom year net loss HK$15.55 mln.</title>
<headline>Culturecom year net loss HK$15.55 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   1.43 loss  vs  6.38 loss</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil	  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			    15.55 loss vs  69.37 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		     363.01     vs  488.86</p>
<p>    Company name		 Culturecom Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  August 12-20</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Culturecom publishes comic books and newspapers.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
